# Three stars of 70+2x%, so 216% a target at level 1 and 330% at max -- level
# with Double Stab there, and ahead of it every step before. GMS runs 65+3x
# over 15 levels; the max is preserved at 110% a star. Claw-only, and the claw
# is what makes the two skills differ: equipped throwing stars add their attack
# to a claw's swing and to nothing else.
# "7 lucky throwing stars" is the skill's own boast, not a count of anything:
# GMS throws three and always has. Kept as the wiki words it, because the name
# is built on the seven.
name: "Lucky Seven"
skill_order: 2
description: "Throw lucky throwing stars to attack enemies in front."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ROGUE
max_level: 20
base_delay_ms: 690
lines: 3
max_enemies: 5
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
base {
  skill_pct: 0.72
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.02
}
